\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Research landscape map for robust RAG. The figure organizes the literature by where robustness problems and methods sit in the RAG stack: evidence-centric work controls the reliability of retrieved inputs, model-centric work controls how the generator uses evidence, system-centric work studies control decisions, and evaluation work measures robustness and action quality.}}{22}{figure.caption.23}\protected@file@percent }
